        Check if JSON field limit scan is ON or OFF. Default value: OFF Possible values = ON, OFF
    .PARAMETER JsonFieldScanlimit
        Field scan limit value for JSON. Default value: 2048 Minimum value = 0 Maximum value = 16384
    .PARAMETER JsonMessageScan
        Check if JSON message limit scan is ON or OFF. Default value: OFF Possible values = ON, OFF
    .PARAMETER JsonMessageScanlimit
